graph TB
    Admin["Cluster Admin / OLM"] -->|creates singleton| KueueCR["Kueue CR 'cluster'<br/>kueue.openshift.io/v1<br/>Cluster-scoped"]
    OLM["OLM Bundle<br/>kueue-operator-bundle<br/>channel: alpha"] -->|installs| Operator

    subgraph NS["Namespace: openshift-kueue-operator"]
        subgraph OperatorPod["openshift-kueue-operator Deployment - 2 replicas"]
            Operator["TargetConfigReconciler<br/>library-go controllercmd<br/>SA: openshift-kueue-operator<br/>metrics 60000/TCP"]
            Bindata["Embedded bindata<br/>bindata/assets/kueue-operator/*"]
            Bindata -.->|static manifests| Operator
        end

        subgraph OperandPod["kueue-controller-manager Deployment - 2 replicas, created by operator"]
            Manager["Kueue /manager<br/>SA: kueue-controller-manager<br/>webhook 9443, metrics 8443<br/>health 8081, visibility 8082 disabled"]
        end

        ConfigMap["ConfigMap<br/>kueue-manager-config<br/>Kueue Configuration v1beta1"]
        Services["Services<br/>kueue-webhook-service 443→9443<br/>metrics-service 8443<br/>kueue-visibility-server 443→8082 no listener"]
        NetPol["NetworkPolicies<br/>default-deny + allow API/DNS/<br/>metrics/webhook/visibility"]
        ServiceMonitor["ServiceMonitor<br/>monitoring.coreos.com/v1"]
        CertMgrObjs["cert-manager objects<br/>Issuer selfsigned<br/>Certificate webhook-cert / metrics-certs"]
    end

    KueueCR -->|watched by| Operator
    Operator -->|renders + applies| ConfigMap
    Operator -->|creates| Manager
    Operator -->|creates| Services
    Operator -->|creates| NetPol
    Operator -->|creates| ServiceMonitor
    Operator -->|creates| CertMgrObjs
    Operator -->|installs 11 CRDs| KueueCRDs["kueue.x-k8s.io CRDs<br/>ClusterQueue, LocalQueue, Workload,<br/>ResourceFlavor, Cohort, Topology,<br/>AdmissionCheck, WorkloadPriorityClass,<br/>MultiKueueConfig/Cluster,<br/>ProvisioningRequestConfig"]
    Operator -->|creates, framework-filtered| Webhooks["Mutating + Validating<br/>WebhookConfigurations<br/>failurePolicy: Fail<br/>nsSelector kueue.openshift.io/managed=true"]
    Operator -->|creates ~40| ClusterRoles["ClusterRoles + Bindings<br/>kueue-manager-role, editor/viewer roles"]

    ConfigMap -->|mounted config| Manager
    Webhooks -->|routes admission to| Services
    Services --> Manager
    Manager -->|reconciles| KueueCRDs

    User["Data Scientist"] -->|submits job with queue-name label| Jobs["Workloads<br/>Job, JobSet, PyTorchJob/TFJob/MPIJob,<br/>RayJob/RayCluster, AppWrapper,<br/>LWS, Pod/Deployment/StatefulSet"]
    Jobs -->|admitted / unsuspended by| Manager

    Operator -->|hard gate: requires Issuer API| CertManager["cert-manager<br/>cert-manager.io/v1"]
    CertManager -->|issues TLS Secrets + injects CA| CertMgrObjs
    Prometheus["OpenShift Monitoring<br/>prometheus-k8s"] -->|scrapes 8443| Manager
    RHODS["rhods-operator<br/>Kueue integration"] -.->|consumes kueue.x-k8s.io APIs| KueueCRDs

    MustGather["kueue-must-gather image<br/>oc adm must-gather"] -.->|collects diagnostics| NS

